3524776344	ucdt	Drop into a high-intensity shooter and rack up a kill streak or just add to the chaos. You either kick ass or get rekt in this mad spectacle. What began as a mode, ZRevive is a fast-paced shooter comprised of multiple, fight-to-the-death game modes, including PLAYERUNKNOWN'S Battle Royale. Players compete in large-scale chaotic PvP spectacles of skill, wit and a little luck to see if they have what it takes to stand at the top of the podium.  Currently, the game includes four variations of Battle Royale - regular, zombie, 2-Man Team, and 5-Man Team, with additional game modes planned throughout the Early Access development process. 
If you owned H1Z1 prior to February 17, 2016 (when the game split into H1Z1: Just Survive and ZRevive), you already own a copy of each game. 

